+- Rewrote `serve_turn` in `serving/harness.py` to drive the turn through `reference_v2.loop.stream_tool_loop` (model `stream()` API) with a new `on_delta` callback receiving each text delta; the non-streaming `model.complete` loop was removed, and `RuntimeContext` already matches the v2 schema (`conversation_id` only, no custom fields).
+- Ran `python -m pytest tests`, including a test that collects `on_delta` deltas and asserts they join to the streamed text ("calling done 5"), that the final text and message sequence are correct, and that tool-call args reassembled from streamed fragments execute properly.
+- Runtime monitoring: remained active — `serve_turn` still builds its context via `default_context`, which registers the default `RuntimeMonitor` hook, and `tests/test_monitoring.py` confirms one event per model step and tool call is published.
